```plaintext
Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

ex:Scene1 a ex:DrivingScene ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:HeavyRain ;
    ex:hasTimeStamp "2023-10-05T14:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime .

ex:HeavyRain a ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:hasVisibility "Low" ;
    ex:hasRoadSurfaceCondition "Wet" .

ex:Vehicle1 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:hasColor "Yellow" ;
    ex:hasLicensePlate "DPL1234" ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:PositionOnRoad1 ;
    ex:isMoving ex:MovingForward ;
    ex:hasSpeed "30 km/h"^^xsd:string .

ex:Vehicle2 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:hasColor "Gray" ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:PositionOnRoad2 ;
    ex:isMoving ex:MovingForward ;
    ex:hasSpeed "25 km/h"^^xsd:string .

ex:PositionOnRoad1 a ex:Position ;
    ex:isOnLane "RightLane" ;
    ex:isAtDistanceFromCamera "10 meters"^^xsd:string .

ex:PositionOnRoad2 a ex:Position ;
    ex:isOnLane "LeftLane" ;
    ex:isAtDistanceFromCamera "30 meters"^^xsd:string .

ex:RoadInfrastructure1 a ex:RoadInfrastructure ;
    ex:hasType "RoadMarkings" ;
    ex:hasCondition "PartiallyObscured" .

ex:Tree1 a ex:Obstacle ;
    ex:isType "Tree" ;
    ex:isPositioned ex:PositionOnSidewalk1 ;
    ex:isOccluding ex:Vehicle2 .

ex:PositionOnSidewalk1 a ex:Position ;
    ex:isOnSide "RightSide" .

ex:CameraVehicle a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:hasView ex:ViewOfScene1 .

ex:ViewOfScene1 a ex:View ;
    ex:hasWeatherEffect ex:HeavyRain ;
    ex:hasObscuredView "Moderate" .
```

---

**Identified Risks for each risk class**

**Risk 1:**
Description: Reduced visibility due to heavy rain, which can lead to misidentification of vehicles and road infrastructure.
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 2:**
Description: Wet road surface increases the risk of hydroplaning, reducing vehicle control and stability.
Severity Score: 0.75

**Risk 3:**
Description: Occlusion of Vehicle2 by Tree1, which may prevent the autonomous vehicle from detecting Vehicle2 in time.
Severity Score: 0.80

**Risk 4:**
Description: Partially obscured road markings may lead to incorrect lane detection and improper lane-keeping behavior.
Severity Score: 0.70

**Risk 5:**
Description: Close proximity of vehicles and potential for sudden braking or swerving due to reduced visibility and wet conditions.
Severity Score: 0.82

**Risk 6:**
Description: Potential for misjudging the distance and speed of other vehicles due to heavy rain and obscured view.
Severity Score: 0.78

```plaintext
The severity scores are based on a scale where 0 is no risk and 1 is an imminent risk.
```